<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Keep operations running" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Keep operations running</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Prevent significant economic losses and safety risks from power interruptions and maintain integrity during power source transitions.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Avoid unplanned shutdowns" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Avoid unplanned shutdowns</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Avoid expensive shutdowns in your industrial processes. Enable effective power transfers for reduced manufacturing and operational impact.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Maintain flexibility" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Maintain flexibility</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Adapt the flexible SIPROTEC 5 architecture for a variety of industrial and power plant applications. Configure single, sectionalized or double busbars with multiple incomers, and apply predefined templates.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Ultra-fast switching times" id="G_Ultra-fast%20switching%20times-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Ultra-fast%20switching%20times-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Ultra-fast%20switching%20times-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Ultra-fast%20switching%20times-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Ultra-fast switching times</h3><div id="G_Ultra-fast%20switching%20times-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Realize ultra-fast switching times up to 10ms with the improved 7VU85 algorithm. Achieve approximately 1ms closing times using high-speed binary output contacts for quick and efficient power supply transfers.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="SIPROTEC 5 and DIGSI" id="G_SIPROTEC%205%20and%20DIGSI-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_SIPROTEC%205%20and%20DIGSI-1-title" aria-describedby="G_SIPROTEC%205%20and%20DIGSI-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_SIPROTEC%205%20and%20DIGSI-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">SIPROTEC 5 and DIGSI</h3><div id="G_SIPROTEC%205%20and%20DIGSI-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Engineer complex applications with DIGSI, even for systems up to 20 circuit-breakers. SIPROTEC 5&#x27;s flexible architecture provides protection and monitoring for diverse applications.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Communication modules" id="G_Communication%20modules-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Communication%20modules-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Communication%20modules-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20modules-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication modules</h3><div id="G_Communication%20modules-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use optional, pluggable communication modules for different protocols (IEC 61850-8-1, IEC 61850-9-2 Client, IEC 61850-9-2 Merging Unit, IEC 60870-5-103, IEC 60870-5-104, Modbus TCP, DNP3 serial and TCP, PROFINET IO).</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp-en-US.json" page-id="Yivu4LJRQhLgPUcx5ENXO" container="comp-5a55FNQDze6liIaiaFNuxp"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='3jiuLoBDjSTU2cLyDp999Z' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-til